    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(All the visuals and game mechanics you see are incomplete and in their initial stage)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><br>Hell Gangs</i> is a multiplayer physics-based adventure game where you and your gang must escape a massive underground prison controlled by a ruthless AI. Chained together, you\u2019ll rely on teamwork to climb, solve chaotic puzzles, and survive dynamic challenges as the AI manipulates the environment to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.poster.avif?t=1736791431\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.webm?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.mp4?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to solve puzzles, navigate collapsing structures, and face unexpected dangers as the AI manipulates the environment in real time to crush your escape. Whether solo or in co-op, every choice matters. Trust your team, outwit the AI, and discover the secrets of the prison\u2019s sinister purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.poster.avif?t=1736791431\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.webm?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.mp4?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re climbing crumbling walls, swinging over deadly gaps, or outsmarting traps, every move is a test of skill and coordination. Play solo or with friends, and see if your gang has what it takes to outwit the AI and escape its twisted experiments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(All the visuals and game mechanics you see are incomplete and in their initial stage)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><br>Hell Gangs</i> is a multiplayer physics-based adventure game where you and your gang must escape a massive underground prison controlled by a ruthless AI. Chained together, you\u2019ll rely on teamwork to climb, solve chaotic puzzles, and survive dynamic challenges as the AI manipulates the environment to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.poster.avif?t=1736791431\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.webm?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/a0ff2d724912aad11e368de185c2969f.mp4?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to solve puzzles, navigate collapsing structures, and face unexpected dangers as the AI manipulates the environment in real time to crush your escape. Whether solo or in co-op, every choice matters. Trust your team, outwit the AI, and discover the secrets of the prison\u2019s sinister purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.poster.avif?t=1736791431\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.webm?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432220/extras/362f93e48777321209cf08a61c6f04be.mp4?t=1736791431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re climbing crumbling walls, swinging over deadly gaps, or outsmarting traps, every move is a test of skill and coordination. Play solo or with friends, and see if your gang has what it takes to outwit the AI and escape its twisted experiments.</p>",
